1
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,160
General Ning,

2
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:55,720
it's not like that.

3
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,160
-I was trying to--
-You

4
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,800
still dare to assassinate our general!

5
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,130
I... It's not like that.

6
00:00:59,200 --> 00:00:59,720
I...

7
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:16,320
Can you stop stabbing me here?

8
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:22,520
I finally took care of the assassin,

9
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,760
only for Ning Yuanci

10
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,880
to mistake me for the killer.

11
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,160
Actor Xia Yimo,

12
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:27,320
your story mission as Madam Qin

13
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:28,480
has failed.

14
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,039
You only have two chances left.

15
00:01:30,039 --> 00:01:31,320
I know how to count.

16
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:35,960
Then are you ready

17
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,600
to enter the next role?

18
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,479
Wait, let me catch my breath.

19
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,000
The first time...

20
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:45,539
I played the maid Xiaolan.

21
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:47,320
I must have accidentally
bumped into the killer

22
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,360
assassinating Xue Ruowan,

23
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,820
which led to my tragic end.

24
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,479
The second time,

25
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:55,210
I played Cui Hu and was stabbed.

26
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:57,520
But Ning Yuanci didn't seem to know

27
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,720
the assassin would appear,

28
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,780
and even told me to kill the assassin.

29
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:03,800
I am not.

30
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,400
The third time,
I transmigrated into Lady Qin.

31
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,820
But she and Ning Yuanci

32
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,120
simply didn't have the time

33
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,440
to make a move on Xue Ruowan.

34
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,200
But Xue Ruowan

35
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:13,530
unexpectedly fell into the lake and died.

36
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,320
Then,

37
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,960
the most suspicious person is...

38
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:20,640
How could I forget

39
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,040
such a key figure?

40
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,640
There is only one truth.

41
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:27,440
I think I know

42
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,500
what the answer is.

43
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,720
I've never won a lottery

44
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,720
in my entire life.

45
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:35,640
Whatever,

46
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,410
I'll just take a wild guess.

47
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,200
I actually drew

48
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:08,130
the hidden character, Xue Keying.

49
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,220
What did you...

50
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,490
what did you just make me drink?

51
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,760
You actually drugged me.

52
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:23,640
Drugged?

53
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:24,880
Could I

54
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,280
be...

55
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,480
Muscle-relaxing powder again.

56
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,079
Help!

57
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,880
Do family drama series have to include

58
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,160
drugging plots?

59
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,000
What... what are you doing?

60
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,260
Why are you doing this?

61
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,460
It's... it's none of my business.

62
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,680
If you want to blame someone,

63
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,320
blame those who force

64
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,180
intimate scenes into the script.

65
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:49,650
Oh right,

66
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,090
I have the antidote.

67
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,400
Quick,

68
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,440
take this.

69
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:57,920
Come on.

70
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,490
Are you alright?

71
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,560
Xue Keying,

72
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,620
you really didn't have to do this.

73
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,520
Even though

74
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,360
I am to marry Xue Ruowan tomorrow,

75
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,360
I have no feelings

76
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,640
for her at all.

77
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,440
All you do is brainwash women.

78
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:41,840
So you bear no responsibility

79
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,720
at all?

80
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,400
Wait.

81
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:50,220
Tonight is the night before the wedding.

82
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,560
Sun Xiaofei!

83
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,280
Let go!

84
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,080
I won't!

85
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,680
Help!

86
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,900
Somebody help!

87
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,280
Someone is dead!

88
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,520
My Lady...

89
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,810
My Lady fell into the lake and died!

90
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,440
Wait.

91
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:05,520
I see.

92
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,810
Someone is trying to frame you.

93
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,450
Xue Keying, what are you doing?

94
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:19,840
Forgive me.

95
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:34,640
Ning Yuanci!

96
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,080
It's alright now.

97
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,460
The danger has passed.

98
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,260
Xue Ruowan!

99
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,570
You can come out now.

100
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,970
I forgot I tied you up there.

101
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,520
Xue Keying,

102
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,540
what on earth are you trying to do?

103
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:12,480
I...

104
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,660
I will explain it to you later.

105
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,020
Did you arrange

106
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,480
the assassins?

107
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,200
No.

108
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,400
Those assassins clearly
wanted to kill her.

109
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,130
How could she have arranged it?

110
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,000
Xue Keying said

111
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,680
someone used my sword

112
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,640
to frame

113
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,200
me.

114
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:30,080
So,

115
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,920
you poisoned me and Xue Keying.

116
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:34,280
You did all this

117
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,240
just to avoid marrying me.

118
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,640
Poisoning? Assassins?

119
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,480
I know absolutely nothing about this!

120
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,740
You are overthinking.

121
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:42,720
Xue Ruowan is just

122
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,120
a frail cripple.

123
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,360
How could she be capable of this?

124
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,140
Based on my deduction,

125
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:50,000
the assassin should be...

126
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,120
I can't let him suspect

127
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,040
Xue Ruowan,

128
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,960
or she'll end up badly

129
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,840
just like me.

130
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,080
I haven't read the script either.

131
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,740
God knows who the assassin is.

132
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,840
How am I supposed to make this up?

133
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:06,400
It's a spy from the Northern Border.

134
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,440
My father said

135
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:11,200
the General has been clearing out spies
from the Northern Border lately.

136
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,440
I have made many enemies.

137
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,400
That person obviously wanted to kill you.

138
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,840
Probably because they couldn't beat you,

139
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,560
they

140
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,380
targeted your bride instead.

141
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,920
General,
you must investigate this thoroughly.

142
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,280
Before we find out the truth,

143
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:24,080
I think we should

144
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,880
cancel tomorrow's wedding.

145
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,960
Just in case something else goes wrong.

146
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,490
The wedding can be delayed,

147
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,840
but it's impossible

148
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,700
for the Xue family to back out.

149
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,810
Rest assured, General.

150
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,280
I won't burden my father,

151
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,560
nor will I implicate the Xue family.

152
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,690
Since I have agreed,

153
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,580
I will never go back on my word.

154
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,680
Is this wedding plot

155
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,080
really necessary?

156
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,760
I never expected such a thing

157
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:05,360
to happen on the wedding day.

158
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,080
Fortunately, Wan'er is safe and sound.

159
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,680
However,

160
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,280
General, bringing your men
to search my residence

161
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,810
is perhaps inappropriate.

162
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,200
The assassin is not in my manor.

163
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,880
I fear that if this happens again,

164
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,920
both you, Duke, and I will lose face.

165
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,400
And we won't be able
to explain it to His Majesty.

166
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,120
The search is merely routine.

167
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:27,560
In case the assassin

168
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,240
left any clues behind.

169
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,250
Rest assured, Duke.

170
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,960
If it truly is Northern spies

171
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,220
seeking revenge on me,

172
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,280
I will uproot them

173
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,080
without mercy.

174
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,400
You jinx.

175
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:49,920
You brought thieves here

176
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,240
before you even got married.

177
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,880
Even if you marry the general,

178
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,320
you'll just be a curse to him.

179
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,560
If Ning Yuanci hadn't

180
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,820
forced me to marry him,

181
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:57,880
why would I suffer

182
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,040
such an unprovoked disaster?

183
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,400
How dare you talk back to Madam?

184
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:00,930
Exactly.

185
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,570
I'll tear your mouth apart.

186
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,040
Stop!

187
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:10,320
How come whenever I look away,

188
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,720
you're getting beaten up again?

189
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,320
At least fight back a little.

190
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,860
Don't pretend to be the good guy here.

191
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,840
Who knows what you and your mother

192
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,200
are plotting again?

193
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:23,520
How dare you bully my Ying'er?

194
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:23,880
I...

195
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:25,600
Your Highness,

196
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,040
stop.

197
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,090
Listen to me, all of you.

198
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:30,920
I don't like Ning Yuanci anymore.

199
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:31,840
From now on,

200
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:35,420
no one is allowed to bully or beat
Xue Ruowan in this residence.

201
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:39,800
Ying'er,

202
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,650
are you alright?

203
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,640
Mother.

204
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,560
I'm fine.

205
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,600
And also,

206
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,080
stop saying

207
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,640
she brings bad luck to her husband.

208
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,480
I think Ning Yuanci is the one
who brings bad luck to his wives.

209
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,210
Whoever marries him is doomed.

210
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,720
At this rate,

211
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,640
I've lost three lives

212
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,810
before the first episode is even over.

213
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,970
How am I supposed to survive
until the finale?

214
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,520
How could I forget the male lead?

215
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,460
According to the plot of Mo Xiang,

216
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,180
the female lead Xue Ruowan

217
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,840
breaks free from the shackles
of feudal marriage,

218
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,840
and runs a painting
and calligraphy business

219
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,160
with her childhood sweetheart,
Chu Qingyun.

220
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,600
After going through hardships,

221
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,360
they finally get together.

222
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,120
Does that mean as long as I find
the male lead,

223
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:21,880
I can push the plot forward

224
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:22,720
quickly?

225
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:25,880
I'm sorry.

226
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,240
I wasn't looking where I was going.

227
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:29,170
Where did these flowers come from?

228
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,440
Have I seen you

229
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,720
somewhere before?

230
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,450
I am Chu Qingyun,

231
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:39,040
a traditional Chinese painter.

232
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,480
I'm here to deliver a painting
to the Duke.

233
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,610
You are Chu Qingyun?

234
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,680
Handsome,

235
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,730
do you have time to do me a favor?

236
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,680
Am I not attractive enough?
